WEBVTT

00:24.524 --> 00:29.027
‎Once clear of the Boomboom family,
‎the damage mostly wore off.

00:29.028 --> 00:31.781
‎I might not be fully healed though.

00:32.532 --> 00:34.325
‎What kind of trick is that?

00:34.909 --> 00:39.288
‎Rather than a trick, it might be better
‎to think of it as a curse.

00:39.289 --> 00:40.290
‎A curse?

00:40.999 --> 00:42.791
‎It seems that once they touch you,

00:42.792 --> 00:47.254
‎getting caught between the three of them
‎triggers a powerful attack.

00:47.255 --> 00:49.673
‎A curse that pulls iron.

00:49.674 --> 00:51.468
‎Like magnets pulling together.

00:54.220 --> 00:56.305
‎It's late, but we have no choice.

00:56.306 --> 00:59.142
‎We have to keep moving
‎so they don't catch up.

01:03.271 --> 01:05.439
‎Gyro! Someone's coming after us!

01:05.440 --> 01:07.066
‎It's the Boomboom family.

01:07.067 --> 01:10.235
‎The magnetic pull will start again
‎if they get too close!

01:10.236 --> 01:12.322
‎Don't let them catch up to us.

01:20.371 --> 01:23.958
‎Johnny Joestar is the killer
‎of three competitors.

01:24.834 --> 01:27.212
‎And given the situation…

01:27.962 --> 01:30.048
‎I'll arrest him and put an end to this.

01:30.548 --> 01:31.758
‎Dead or alive!

01:55.532 --> 01:57.784
‎STEEL BALL RUN
‎JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE

03:12.275 --> 03:18.239
‎#04
‎THE DEVIL'S PALM

03:24.203 --> 03:28.457
‎Damn! He hasn't
‎slowed down one bit, has he?

03:28.458 --> 03:31.960
‎Even though both his horse and ours
‎should be at their limit.

03:31.961 --> 03:33.962
‎Something's off.

03:33.963 --> 03:36.381
‎Is that really the Boomboom family?

03:36.382 --> 03:40.011
‎That strange hat…
‎I feel like I've seen it before.

03:42.347 --> 03:44.182
‎Gyro! What's with him?

03:44.766 --> 03:47.018
‎He's already over the rise!

03:48.228 --> 03:50.521
‎Wait… I know him.

03:51.272 --> 03:52.648
‎It's Mountain Tim!

03:52.649 --> 03:55.652
‎Why is he chasing us?

03:56.611 --> 04:00.782
‎Good. They're almost
‎within magnetic range.

04:02.992 --> 04:07.663
‎Those three magnets
‎will have no choice but to stick together.

04:07.664 --> 04:11.376
‎Then they'll tear themselves apart
‎and spill their guts, right?

04:33.856 --> 04:36.984
‎Damn! We've been running nonstop.

04:36.985 --> 04:38.568
‎He's still speeding up.

04:38.569 --> 04:39.821
‎That's insane!

04:40.947 --> 04:42.365
‎No. Gyro.

04:43.366 --> 04:47.161
‎I'm starting to understand.
‎That's not what's going on.

04:48.329 --> 04:51.958
‎He is speeding up. But that's not all!

04:52.959 --> 04:57.046
‎I'm being pulled backward!

05:00.341 --> 05:01.551
‎Johnny!

05:05.638 --> 05:09.391
‎Yes! He fell off his horse.
‎That settles it!

05:09.392 --> 05:10.475
‎Awesome!

05:10.476 --> 05:12.561
‎Way to go, Mountain Tim!

05:12.562 --> 05:16.482
‎All that's left is for the three magnets
‎to stick together!

05:17.859 --> 05:19.901
‎Dad, let's go watch!

05:19.902 --> 05:25.574
‎I want to see them tear themselves apart
‎and spill their guts up close!

05:25.575 --> 05:26.576
‎Yeah!

05:34.208 --> 05:38.795
‎Hey, Dad… I feel cold.

05:38.796 --> 05:41.506
‎My vision's blurry and I'm so cold.

05:41.507 --> 05:44.593
‎I think something's really wrong with me.

05:44.594 --> 05:49.264
‎Cold? We've got bigger things
‎to worry about, Andrew.

05:49.265 --> 05:52.018
‎Is that really what matters right now?

06:00.359 --> 06:04.404
‎I've somehow become a human magnet too!

06:04.405 --> 06:08.325
‎Johnny. When did they touch you?

06:08.326 --> 06:10.494
‎You must've been touched somewhere!

06:10.495 --> 06:12.580
‎I have no idea.

06:13.122 --> 06:15.624
‎Maybe it was the bullet.

06:15.625 --> 06:18.960
‎The bullet Benny Boomboom fired…

06:18.961 --> 06:21.379
‎Maybe it had something on it!

06:21.380 --> 06:24.382
‎Damn it! We've got to find them.

06:24.383 --> 06:26.134
‎Where are they?

06:26.135 --> 06:29.263
‎They've got to be nearby
‎controlling this magnetism.

06:34.727 --> 06:37.938
‎Maybe they've already done their part.

06:37.939 --> 06:41.775
‎Mountain Tim… I don't know
‎why he's after us,

06:41.776 --> 06:44.153
‎but this started when he got close to us.

06:52.328 --> 06:55.205
‎Hey, Johnny. What are you doing?

06:55.206 --> 06:57.874
‎I'm being dragged backward.

06:57.875 --> 06:59.293
‎You're being pulled too, Gyro!

07:08.136 --> 07:12.556
‎It's Mountain Tim! He must've been touched
‎by them somewhere too!

07:12.557 --> 07:17.186
‎The three of us have been pulling
‎each other without realizing it!

07:18.062 --> 07:21.022
‎With only two of us,
‎it was probably too weak to notice.

07:21.023 --> 07:24.651
‎But when all three of us got close,
‎we all started pulling one another.

07:24.652 --> 07:28.489
‎The magnetic force combined
‎and reached its maximum!

07:29.615 --> 07:32.660
‎We're pulled backward while he speeds up!

07:35.204 --> 07:37.414
‎How is he still on his horse?

07:37.415 --> 07:41.293
‎He doesn't realize it
‎because he's riding straight toward us!

07:41.294 --> 07:43.546
‎What happens if he reaches us?

07:45.131 --> 07:49.093
‎My skin… The iron in my blood
‎is being drawn together.

07:50.720 --> 07:53.013
‎Don't let him get any closer!

07:53.014 --> 07:57.184
‎If he gets any closer,
‎all three of us will burst apart!

07:57.185 --> 07:59.687
‎We've got to warn him
‎to get off his horse!

08:00.980 --> 08:04.941
‎What? Why is Johnny Joestar off his horse?

08:04.942 --> 08:09.112
‎Gyro Zeppeli's there too.
‎They're shouting something.

08:09.113 --> 08:12.200
‎Stop! Stay back!

08:12.825 --> 08:15.952
‎No! He can't hear us!
‎He's coming straight at us!

08:15.953 --> 08:20.790
‎Even if he could hear us,
‎I doubt he'd just get off his horse.

08:20.791 --> 08:25.087
‎If we don't tell him he's been magnetized,
‎all three of us will die!

08:25.838 --> 08:29.550
‎Right. Then let's get him off his horse!

08:33.471 --> 08:36.097
‎No, Gyro! It won't reach him!

08:36.098 --> 08:40.060
‎The Steel Ball will come right back
‎to your magnetized body!

08:40.061 --> 08:42.062
‎I know, Johnny.

08:42.063 --> 08:46.692
‎The magnetism will pull the Steel Ball
‎back to me, right?

08:47.735 --> 08:50.696
‎That's the part I'm counting on.

08:51.864 --> 08:55.159
‎It's enough to pull him off his horse.

08:56.452 --> 08:58.662
‎I scattered the rubble.

08:58.663 --> 09:00.664
‎But it's gonna hurt bad…

09:00.665 --> 09:05.001
‎All three of us.
‎Because we're all magnetic now.

09:05.002 --> 09:07.963
‎There's iron in the rock.

09:07.964 --> 09:10.091
‎Cover yourself, Johnny!

09:17.306 --> 09:18.391
‎What the…

09:19.267 --> 09:23.228
‎We did it!
‎We pulled Mountain Tim off his horse!

09:23.229 --> 09:25.939
‎What's this force pulling me in?

09:25.940 --> 09:28.818
‎My gun's being pulled onto my arm!

09:32.488 --> 09:35.198
‎No, Gyro… We got too close.

09:35.199 --> 09:38.660
‎We'd already gotten too close!

09:38.661 --> 09:40.955
‎He's flying right at us!

09:44.542 --> 09:46.752
‎My blood vessels are bursting!

09:47.670 --> 09:49.547
‎Lasso Blues!

09:57.013 --> 09:58.514
‎What the hell is that?

10:00.891 --> 10:02.309
‎I threw my rope.

10:02.310 --> 10:05.605
‎I can move my body in pieces
‎as far as the rope reaches.

10:06.355 --> 10:11.401
‎Looks like if we get any closer,
‎something bad will happen.

10:11.402 --> 10:12.485
‎Shit!

10:12.486 --> 10:14.571
‎What's wrong, Dad?

10:14.572 --> 10:18.284
‎They're gonna get away!
‎We've got to cut that rope!

10:20.703 --> 10:24.749
‎I guess I was chasing the wrong man,
‎Johnny Joestar.

10:26.125 --> 10:30.463
‎This magnetic force pulling me…
‎Whose ability is it?

10:31.047 --> 10:34.884
‎Explain it to me. What's happening?

10:39.305 --> 10:40.221
‎LASSO BLUES
‎MOUNTAIN TIM

10:40.222 --> 10:41.057
‎TOMB OF THE NOISE 123
‎THE BOOMBOOM FAMILY

10:41.891 --> 10:45.393
‎I see. The culprits
‎are the Boomboom family.

10:45.394 --> 10:47.646
‎They have the ability to manipulate iron.

10:47.647 --> 10:50.941
‎So if I approach you
‎without knowing, I'll die.

10:51.484 --> 10:53.109
‎I'll move further away.

10:53.110 --> 10:55.362
‎Just what are you?

10:55.363 --> 10:57.990
‎The Boomboom family's one thing,
‎but you too.

10:58.699 --> 11:01.452
‎Are you even human? What's going on?

11:02.161 --> 11:05.789
‎What about you?
‎What's with that steel ball?

11:05.790 --> 11:08.083
‎Mine's just a technique.

11:08.084 --> 11:10.419
‎There's still a lot
‎we don't know about humans.

11:12.296 --> 11:16.008
‎I see. There's still much
‎we don't know about humans.

11:17.426 --> 11:20.346
‎I'll keep it brief. It was 15 years ago.

11:22.306 --> 11:24.432
‎Back in 1875,

11:24.433 --> 11:28.019
‎I was 16 and had joined the military.

11:28.020 --> 11:33.317
‎We were assigned to explore
‎an uncharted area of this Arizona desert.

11:34.443 --> 11:37.612
‎But my cavalry troop got lost,

11:37.613 --> 11:40.491
‎wandering for days in search of water.

11:43.994 --> 11:49.125
‎The area was feared by local tribes
‎who called it the "Devil's Palm."

11:49.708 --> 11:51.836
‎We walked right into it.

11:52.962 --> 11:56.172
‎Compasses didn't work at all there.

11:56.173 --> 11:59.051
‎Quicksand kept the ground
‎constantly shifting.

11:59.760 --> 12:01.469
‎And that wasn't all.

12:01.470 --> 12:05.098
‎Entire mountains vanished,
‎valleys appeared,

12:05.099 --> 12:07.392
‎and the terrain kept changing.

12:07.393 --> 12:09.395
‎That's how we lost our way.

12:10.062 --> 12:14.233
‎They say the Devil's Palm
‎moves several miles a day.

12:14.900 --> 12:19.237
‎No one knows how large it is
‎or where it is.

12:19.238 --> 12:21.323
‎According to the local tribes' legend,

12:22.032 --> 12:25.785
‎a falling star destroyed everything
‎long ago.

12:25.786 --> 12:27.913
‎The whole area was left cursed.

12:30.291 --> 12:32.585
‎We never found water.

12:40.217 --> 12:44.221
‎It was also a place
‎where one could reshape fate.

12:51.479 --> 12:53.564
‎For some reason, I woke up.

12:54.565 --> 12:55.941
‎It was late at night.

12:58.569 --> 13:02.156
‎A small amount of dew formed on my rope.

13:04.283 --> 13:06.744
‎My body soaked it up.

13:07.328 --> 13:08.662
‎Unconsciously…

13:10.080 --> 13:12.958
‎my body had become one with the rope.

13:14.001 --> 13:16.170
‎I was the only one left alive.

13:17.046 --> 13:19.548
‎Perhaps because of some kind of force,

13:20.090 --> 13:25.054
‎the Devil's Palm draws out
‎a person's dormant potential.

13:25.971 --> 13:28.766
‎The Indigenous people
‎call it a cursed power.

13:29.350 --> 13:31.267
‎Maybe they're right.

13:31.268 --> 13:35.064
‎After all, I was supposed to die
‎with everyone else.

13:37.399 --> 13:41.861
‎I personally call this ability "Stand."

13:41.862 --> 13:44.155
‎One who stands against.

13:44.156 --> 13:47.742
‎"Stand… One who stands against"?

13:47.743 --> 13:49.327
‎No doubt about it.

13:49.328 --> 13:52.247
‎The Boomboom family
‎must've entered the Devil's Palm

13:52.248 --> 13:53.748
‎and gained a Stand.

13:53.749 --> 13:55.333
‎So that means

13:55.334 --> 13:58.670
‎the only way to keep moving

13:58.671 --> 14:01.381
‎is to find them and take them down.

14:01.382 --> 14:03.968
‎Nah. I don't think you need to.

14:06.845 --> 14:10.306
‎No need to look for us.
‎No need to stay apart, either.

14:10.307 --> 14:13.936
‎The only way you can move
‎is closer together.

14:15.396 --> 14:16.689
‎Right, Dad?

14:18.482 --> 14:20.483
‎Dad told me so.

14:20.484 --> 14:23.945
‎Need a hand, Laurence?
‎Can you cut the rope yourself?

14:23.946 --> 14:26.739
‎Mountain Tim's rope, I mean.

14:26.740 --> 14:31.078
‎Well… Maybe I can. Maybe I can't.

14:43.549 --> 14:45.884
‎Is this made of iron sand?

14:45.885 --> 14:48.469
‎He's gathering iron sand and shaping it!

14:48.470 --> 14:51.307
‎It's sticking to me. It's so heavy!

14:53.309 --> 14:56.270
‎It's charging straight toward
‎Mountain Tim too!

15:03.277 --> 15:06.780
‎I knew it. You're too reckless
‎on your own, Laurence!

15:07.615 --> 15:10.950
‎Seal up their hands with iron filings too.

15:10.951 --> 15:14.954
‎Oh, Dad! I'm so happy!

15:14.955 --> 15:19.167
‎Happy? Yeah, we sure are!

15:19.168 --> 15:21.336
‎Don't let them do a thing.

15:21.337 --> 15:24.089
‎-Cut Mountain Tim's rope now!
‎-Okay.

15:27.760 --> 15:29.053
‎The rope's been cut!

15:30.012 --> 15:31.221
‎We're done for!

15:35.809 --> 15:36.810
‎So heavy…

15:38.270 --> 15:39.771
‎It's useless.

15:39.772 --> 15:44.485
‎There's nothing you can do
‎in this magnetic field!

15:45.069 --> 15:47.612
‎Johnny. Your hands are free.

15:47.613 --> 15:49.698
‎You're the one who has to do it!

15:50.240 --> 15:52.283
‎The Spin, Johnny.

15:52.284 --> 15:55.244
‎Use the Spin to take them out.

15:55.245 --> 15:57.205
‎There's a bullet right there!

15:57.206 --> 15:58.706
‎Grab it!

15:58.707 --> 16:03.753
‎The bullet's made of lead. It'll fly true
‎even in this magnetic field!

16:03.754 --> 16:06.506
‎Spin that bullet!

16:06.507 --> 16:07.800
‎Me?

16:10.636 --> 16:14.263
‎Johnny, you have to do it!
‎It's Lesson Three!

16:14.264 --> 16:17.142
‎You told me you spun that cork!

16:18.310 --> 16:21.187
‎That was a fluke!

16:21.188 --> 16:23.064
‎Trust the Spin.

16:23.065 --> 16:26.068
‎The Spin holds infinite power. Trust it!

16:28.487 --> 16:29.863
‎No! He's coming!

16:32.282 --> 16:34.325
‎They've merged!

16:34.326 --> 16:36.911
‎How far will their guts fly?

16:36.912 --> 16:39.372
‎Think they'll break the record?

16:39.373 --> 16:40.623
‎We're tearing apart!

16:40.624 --> 16:44.211
‎Johnny! Do it! You have to!

16:46.130 --> 16:49.591
‎Can I really do it?
‎I've only made it spin once.

16:50.175 --> 16:53.845
‎But this is why I entered this race.

16:53.846 --> 16:55.889
‎To learn the secret of the Spin.

16:56.640 --> 16:59.727
‎To master the Spin!

17:00.602 --> 17:04.063
‎Our bodies are gonna burst. Johnny!

17:04.064 --> 17:07.192
‎Do it! Or it'll all end here!

17:12.656 --> 17:16.452
‎It's spinning… It's spinning, Gyro!

17:23.500 --> 17:25.543
‎Laurence. Don't let your guard down.

17:25.544 --> 17:28.797
‎Watch out for
‎a dying man's last-ditch effort.

17:29.798 --> 17:32.718
‎No, Gyro… I couldn't make it.

17:33.218 --> 17:34.970
‎I failed!

17:36.847 --> 17:39.308
‎No… That's not it, Dad.

17:40.225 --> 17:42.895
‎Dad, it's not "Watch out."

17:44.521 --> 17:47.523
‎Get back, Dad! Get away from there now!

17:47.524 --> 17:49.610
‎What's with his hand?

17:53.447 --> 17:55.031
‎Johnny Joestar…

17:55.032 --> 17:56.909
‎What's that?

18:02.206 --> 18:03.706
‎My hand…

18:03.707 --> 18:07.251
‎My nails… What is this? Gyro!

18:07.252 --> 18:10.963
‎What's going on?
‎The Steel Ball's Spin doesn't do that!

18:10.964 --> 18:13.174
‎Could this be…

18:13.175 --> 18:15.802
‎I'm telling you, Dad! Get back!

18:15.803 --> 18:18.430
‎Hurry! Your leg!

18:28.899 --> 18:31.235
‎Dad!

18:35.531 --> 18:37.406
‎What the hell is happening?

18:37.407 --> 18:39.617
‎Gyro! What was that?

18:39.618 --> 18:42.913
‎I haven't got a clue.

18:43.622 --> 18:47.125
‎You bastard! Look what you did to my dad!

18:47.126 --> 18:48.418
‎Johnny!

18:49.253 --> 18:52.881
‎Burst your blood vessels and drop dead!

19:00.597 --> 19:03.015
‎Impossible! My body…

19:03.016 --> 19:04.977
‎My legs… They leaped!

19:05.811 --> 19:07.563
‎No… No way!

19:10.941 --> 19:15.903
‎Gyro, tell me!
‎What's happening to my fingers?

19:15.904 --> 19:19.198
‎That's not the Steel Ball's Spin.

19:19.199 --> 19:21.492
‎It's not any technique I know.

19:21.493 --> 19:24.620
‎If it's more than a technique…

19:24.621 --> 19:27.166
‎No doubt about it. It's a Stand!

19:28.250 --> 19:32.378
‎Johnny Joestar, you've been affected

19:32.379 --> 19:34.255
‎by the Devil's Palm.

19:34.256 --> 19:37.967
‎I think we're standing in it right now.

19:37.968 --> 19:40.595
‎We wandered into it without realizing it.

19:40.596 --> 19:44.557
‎A Stand? Me?

19:44.558 --> 19:47.102
‎Maybe it was just coincidence.

19:47.603 --> 19:50.397
‎Or maybe the land itself pulled us in.

19:52.024 --> 19:53.984
‎Probably the latter.

20:03.493 --> 20:04.952
‎Call your horses!

20:04.953 --> 20:07.371
‎The terrain's changing.

20:07.372 --> 20:09.583
‎Move, or we'll get lost!

20:10.125 --> 20:11.876
‎What? Valkyrie!

20:11.877 --> 20:14.795
‎Wait, you bastards!

20:14.796 --> 20:17.381
‎I'll never forgive you!

20:17.382 --> 20:19.884
‎I'll make you pay.

20:19.885 --> 20:22.554
‎I've still got my brother!

20:23.222 --> 20:26.642
‎Andrew! Take them down!

20:29.394 --> 20:32.813
‎Andrew!

20:32.814 --> 20:36.443
‎Forget about them.
‎The Boomboom family is finished.

20:37.861 --> 20:39.445
‎Maybe so.

20:39.446 --> 20:41.822
‎Gyro Zeppeli!

20:41.823 --> 20:45.660
‎You'll never make it to the finish anyway!

20:45.661 --> 20:49.790
‎You think we're the only ones
‎after your life?

20:54.127 --> 20:56.837
‎We went after you

20:56.838 --> 21:01.384
‎because someone promised us
‎200,000 dollars if you died!

21:01.385 --> 21:05.347
‎You've got a bounty on your head.

21:06.974 --> 21:08.850
‎Who hired you guys?

21:09.851 --> 21:11.895
‎What are you doing? Move!

21:13.689 --> 21:16.649
‎Don't waste time! We'll lose our bearings!

21:16.650 --> 21:21.237
‎Get back here! Come back!

21:21.238 --> 21:23.448
‎I'll kill you!

21:25.659 --> 21:27.159
‎Dad…

21:27.160 --> 21:29.788
‎Andrew…

21:42.843 --> 21:46.263
‎The change that occurred in me…
‎Just what was that?

21:46.972 --> 21:48.849
‎But more importantly…

21:49.433 --> 21:51.226
‎Who is Gyro, really?

21:51.727 --> 21:53.353
‎Is he a wanted man?

21:53.895 --> 21:55.856
‎Just what is he hiding?

23:30.951 --> 23:35.956
‎Subtitle translation by: Ryoko Quirke
